<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Love and Havok</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;They say that the greatest trick the Devil had ever played was convincing the world she didn't exist.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's 20 years since the end of the Great War of Etheria. A lot has happened in those 20 years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-Meeting an alternate dimension version of Adora.&lt;br /&gt;-Rescuing Queen Angella from the void.&lt;br /&gt;-Discovering Adora's twin brother, Adam.&lt;br /&gt;-The Creation of Liq'Ollem&lt;br /&gt;-And Castaspella becoming a popstar for some reason...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;But through it all, peace has been restored. However, the peace did not come without a price. The Great War has left many scars, be it physically, mentally or spiritually. Just when it seems like an equilibrium has been gained, Micah, in all of his wisdom decides to take a new student under his wing, Kazari (Pronounced KAH-Zur-EE). What Kazari doesn't know are secrets about herself. Secrets that has ramifications that'll send ripples through the past, present and future.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>MaxxPhoenixV1</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mature</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Finn | Adora/Catra Child (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Original Characters</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Generational Trauma</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder - PTSD</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Trauma</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mental Health Issues</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Forgiveness</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Reincarnation</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>For the Love of Shadow Weaver Collection (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner's A+ Parenting</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Graphic Depictions Of Violence</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Soap Opera with Extra Steps</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Drama &amp; Romance</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Family Drama</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Dysfunctional Family</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>no beta we die like men</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora Needs Therapy (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>please comment</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
      </dc:subject>
      <dc:publisher>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Archive of Our Own</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
      </dc:publisher>
